    "text": "Annual Higher Ordination of Rohana Sanga Sabhawa",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      377.05,
      539.97,
      448.12
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby informed that the 30th Higher Ordination Ceremony of the Sri Rohana Maha Sangha Sabhawa is to be held on08th, 09th and 10th of May, 2015 at Sri Rohana Sangha Sabhawa of Siri Rathanajothi Piriwena, Urapola, Thihagoda andMangala Seemamalakaya of Randupatha Sri Rohana Uposathagara Maha Vihara, Kotuwegoda, Matara and that the pilgrimsshould refrain from carrying with them any plastic or polythene materials and that the standing orders and regulations underSection 02 of the Pilgrimage Ordinance (Chapter 175 - LDB 11/60) declared on 14th October 1991 and published in the Gazetteof the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, will be in force during the period in which the ceremony is held.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
